                <l xml:id="m-f1c4e741-602d-46e6-998b-7bad376181ee" facs="#m-4ac40aa0-cb5c-431c-84da-a3f29bce3a96" label="text-like">The solemn procession</l><l xml:id="m-9fe8979d-6532-4f37-8017-eeec0bfc9038" facs="#m-1e3eeff3-0f25-4379-990a-efc08e85d7a5" label="ambiguous">589</l><l xml:id="m-154868ea-ccc8-485e-98bb-8c73524854bd" facs="#m-c78111bf-bec3-4cc3-9209-5fecd3277bf0" label="lyrics-like">4. Qui emittit elóquium súum térrae: * velóciter cúrrit</l><l xml:id="m-fac1d550-f305-48d5-8e9d-4131052ba303" facs="#m-099155cc-4317-4d5c-bcdb-3877fcbbc1ee" label="lyrics-like">sérmo éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-da701c57-052b-424d-b6a3-f1fd3816fd1b" facs="#m-512b7470-bbe8-4d7d-b4b2-a61d8c6d5caf" label="lyrics-like">5. Qui dat nivem sicut lánam:*nébulam sicut cinerem spárgit.</l><l xml:id="m-84ba2440-5a37-47b8-bfd4-caf1ad4dcef7" facs="#m-143e2142-c6d8-44a9-aa1f-59c58fcc7862" label="lyrics-like">6. Mittit crystállum súam sicut buccéllas:“ante fáciem</l><l xml:id="m-6e73c4c6-aa3e-490d-b030-17af6ec99353" facs="#m-c44deb0e-1b80-42d2-8444-0333c46e8233" label="lyrics-like">frigoris éjus quis sustinébit?</l><l xml:id="m-727b2491-f763-4a6c-ac62-27f1c2072c91" facs="#m-36e12a14-696c-40ca-8cf2-153865773960" label="lyrics-like">7. Emittet vérbum súum, et liquefáciet éa: * fábit spiritus</l><l xml:id="m-4de89ab3-7f8a-4431-9bbd-53ab484af576" facs="#m-fe6149ad-dbd2-4c84-9baf-400880d6138d" label="lyrics-like">éjus, et flüent áquae.</l><l xml:id="m-fe2d1784-db32-43ee-9cea-ec2be319a5a7" facs="#m-4273f427-dd2f-48a9-aa91-980e6756bf21" label="lyrics-like">8. Qui annúntiat vérbum súum Jácob: *justitias et judicia</l><l xml:id="m-c8f12e69-6e22-49a3-b811-c4bab1c730ef" facs="#m-3dbd7ca9-80ce-4ffa-8464-cd145a97a2a3" label="lyrics-like">súa Israël.</l><l xml:id="m-5a885f36-e6df-4c65-8521-1cd5f569a204" facs="#m-af798ec8-968e-4584-b233-2debc3213aec" label="lyrics-like">9. Non fécit táliter ómni natióni: * et judicia súa non mani¬</l><l xml:id="m-66798bbb-d8e0-4705-b5d0-8863d09656f0" facs="#m-84e4670e-eec0-45a2-ba95-8139fe605b47" label="lyrics-like">festávit éis.</l><l xml:id="m-51b90389-1425-419f-9088-e68d4a61bfcb" facs="#m-c7cf76bf-d824-4092-a5c8-d2c5a6d3b100" label="lyrics-like">10. Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spiritui Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-d38c8525-d3ba-4be3-bd19-4561c6158e14" facs="#m-bc564e0e-4d92-4248-92ce-20baa95fc491" label="lyrics-like">11. Sicut érat in principio, et nunc, et sémper, * et in saécula</l><l xml:id="m-63ee80d5-0560-4114-b238-8f44ba63f8a9" facs="#m-b319d1b5-d21f-461b-bc6a-545da883c809" label="lyrics-like">saeculórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-40184cdd-2320-4fa1-9aa6-3fb01ef34402" facs="#m-c74a2ac8-1c4d-4851-ae0e-6855d1a4b15f" label="lyrics-like">The antiphon Omnes colláudant. is repeated, as abore.</l><l xml:id="m-055e680b-5c2a-4f0d-bf8d-c163519d492c" facs="#m-391d4008-bd8d-4315-af0d-1bb5b69cbbd8" label="ambiguous">XIs.</l><l xml:id="m-ce2a6b1e-14e5-4f77-bc7d-8d3700c1c810" facs="#m-63de236f-5b3f-4a42-8aeb-5a8ced210022" label="ambiguous">6 Ant. E</l><l xml:id="m-00ffdc2a-ea81-4abc-86b9-932fb8add9d5" facs="#m-66118d62-bd30-48b4-9e23-2f0a5d6f4fb6" label="ambiguous">8</l><l xml:id="m-627b8cee-0ae9-4f79-853d-4cc94ac2ce3b" facs="#m-b5123519-66c7-435c-b62b-7984e784ab9a" label="lyrics-like">4 Ulgén-tibus pálmis “prostérnimur</l><l xml:id="m-09782b38-b37a-4d53-acaf-da004b5cec3b" facs="#m-42d4a2a7-3f2a-4f7f-baee-89552ab7260b" label="ambiguous">adve¬</l><l xml:id="m-4a4f70e1-e97c-41b4-8286-ee6184b93155" facs="#m-d79061c5-5aec-4ec6-8a31-dbba18c8ca26" label="lyrics-like">ni- énti Dómi-no: hú-ic ómnes occurrámus cum hýmnis</l><l xml:id="m-c495d655-9156-440e-abb5-b89818225b17" facs="#m-acd44650-7746-432d-818b-811f28c56070" label="lyrics-like">et cánti-cis, glo-ri-fi-cántes</l><l xml:id="m-1535860f-2fa9-4f86-a93d-00243fc775d7" facs="#m-74a7c1a1-67c0-4e9c-8e6e-c8949393b51b" label="lyrics-like">et di-céntes: « Bene-díctus</l><l xml:id="m-9118ab10-c092-4fd3-ac4f-3c288141d515" facs="#m-6e6917f1-b8bd-4f84-834e-a6af640dacaf" label="lyrics-like">Dómi-nus».</l><l xml:id="m-8e109ecb-5c39-47ec-9cc5-e2657805b763" facs="#m-e3cccab1-5a19-458e-8d15-03ecd2588d9f" label="ambiguous">XS.</l><l xml:id="m-7501c3ad-5f12-4c97-b6a8-76b4fba208c4" facs="#m-529b1ca0-8841-497b-8e82-1eeb7556e98c" label="ambiguous">7Ant.8</l><l xml:id="m-c0cff8ef-40b6-4970-a783-b8c88d827dfe" facs="#m-232954fc-37fe-4528-907c-2cd95eb1586f" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-6369305e-f20b-4fc8-afca-057b3fb1d8b6" facs="#m-8c106049-fb31-4581-a5e7-146f0aadba33" label="lyrics-like">ve," Rex nó- ster, Fí-li Dá-vid,</l><l xml:id="m-ecdb56c2-d44f-4acb-965b-c1aae8dee226" facs="#m-06f2bfa6-6c04-46e2-a9f5-051346fa44cf" label="lyrics-like">Red- ém¬</l><l xml:id="m-b2e45dae-6f62-46f9-990f-c9fb0069d980" facs="#m-10510b2a-e51c-4ac0-9a7d-2cc131b74cee" label="lyrics-like">ptor mún- di. quem prophétae praedi-xé¬ runt Salva-tó-rem</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>